OL,3,GNEWSAClimber makes mountaineering
OL,4,Ahistory on the Eiger
OL,5,
OL,6,FImagine spending 13 nights slowly
OL,7,Fclimbing up the side of one of the most
OL,8,Fdangerous rock faces on Earth.
OL,10,FBedford climber Fay Manners, 39, has
OL,11,Fmade mountaineering history doing just
OL,12,Fthat after becoming the first British
OL,13,Fwoman to open a new route on the north
OL,14,Fface of the Eiger in Switzerland on 13
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FThe mountain is famed for its 1,800m
OL,18,F(5,900 ft) vertical north face which
OL,19,Fwas first conquered in 1938.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
