OL,3,GNEWSAClimber makes mountaineering
OL,4,Ahistory on the Eiger
OL,5,
OL,6,FManners said: "It's a mountain where
OL,7,Fwe've seen not only decades of men
OL,8,Fopening routes, but some really
OL,9,Fprominent female figures, soloing the
OL,10,Fnorth face in 17 hours like Catherine
OL,11,FDestivelle.
